5,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning. Before we pick a program, I’d like to understand why past ones struggled.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: Good morning. Before we pick a program, I’d like to understand why past ones struggled.""}]}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. We should review what the earlier attempts actually produced before adding another to the pile.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I want to see the staffing records first. New programs always land on the teams that didn’t ask for them.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I need to know what this budget can actually build and what it would earn back before we commit.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry less about the idea’s merit than whether our rooms, parking, and booking screens can absorb it without seizing up.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
